/terminal/otf-sansguilt/*
!/terminal/otf-sansguilt/PKGBUILD
leftwm

# Homelab secrets — these files aren't hand-authored; a host-level script populates them from
# Proton Pass at deploy time (see core/README.md#secrets-management-proton-pass-cli), so they
# exist on disk as a generated deploy-time artifact even though Proton Pass is the source of
# truth. Never commit real values here — only *.env.example templates.
core/**/.env
core/**/*.key
core/**/*.pem
core/**/secrets/
router/**/.env
router/**/*.key
router/**/*.pem
router/**/secrets/
